We keep centralized instructions for working in this repo in .the_link/ai/RULES.md.

Run the application using Docker Compose. All django commands should be run as follows:

```
docker-compose exec web python manage.py <insert command>
```

Make sure you've read .the_link/ai/RULES.md before making any changes to this repo.